{"step_index":508,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:40Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-04T00:38:40-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-04T00:38:42-06:00\nThe tool's output was truncated due to being too long. You can find the full output in a file at file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.system_generated/steps/508/output.txt.\n\nHere is a preview with the middle of the output truncated:\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n=== C:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\experimento\\14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE\\INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md ===\r\n# Informe de Ingeniería Inversa y Descompilación Estática (REA + JADX + Apktool): `AppUpgradeService.apk` y `ControlDevice.apk`\r\n\r\n**Fecha:** 1 de noviembre de 2026  \r\n**Dispositivo Origen:** ZTE B866V2 (`ViettelBox_B866V2` / `MediaBox_B866V2`)  \r\n**Herramientas Empleadas:** `jadx 1.5.1`, `apktool 2.10.0`, `androguard` / analizador DEX estático REA  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. Resumen Ejecutivo e Inventario de Binarios Extraídos\r\n\r\nSe extrajeron desde la partición del sistema del dispositivo (`192.168.0.47:5555`) seis aplicaciones clave del ecosistema OEM/operador en [`experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo), descompilando a nivel de código fuente Java y recursos XML los dos paquetes principales solicitados:\r\n\r\n| Archivo APK | Ruta en el Dispositivo | Package Name | `sharedUserId` | Tamaño (Bytes) | SHA-256 |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | ---: | :--- |\r\n| [`AppUpgradeService.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/AppUpgradeService.apk) | `/system/app/AppUpgradeService/AppUpgradeService.apk` | `tv.upgrade.service` | `android.uid.system` (`1000`) | `54,239` | `e74d5620c7f2fc10de95e1a036fd956747720cb699186bc2ba94ff8455079d9e` |\r\n| [`ControlDevice.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/ControlDevice.apk) | `/system/system_ext/priv-app/ControlDevice/ControlDevice.apk` | `com.control.device` | `android.uid.system` (`1000`) | `17,876,564` | `35622a5a95db9c71667c8c00fd4856e9829098f819ff1ab54144b71a2678069d` |\r\n| [`DLStore.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/DLStore.apk) | `/system/app/DLStore/DLStore.apk` | — | — | `3,313,530` | `f326b172844ff859a282c81ec1bc26323c2020ee5803d2224605168b7a5e9dc5` |\r\n| [`Hdplay.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/Hdplay.apk) | `/system/app/Hdplay/Hdplay.apk` | — | — | `3,568,385` | `367a8a7827d42c1a9043c196be6a3eb78042fd0c0cb51234ff0c3040dc284cf6` |\r\n| [`Filemanager.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/Filemanager.apk) | `/system/app/Filemanager/Filemanager.apk` | — | — | `5,737,825` | `1b5e0985ade89bc37ade1ab64f53db6090267af5b4fbea015fb6b87f2a215cee` |\r\n| [`AppDMC.apk`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/AppDMC.apk) | `/system/priv-app/AppDMC/AppDMC.apk` | — | — | `577,580` | `2f03eff6dfcd7af4c937113fe8649a667bfea69cc293dfe72adda94459180065` |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 2. Análisis Profundo de `AppUpgradeService.apk` (`tv.upgrade.service`)\r\n\r\n### 2.1. Métricas del Binario y Manifiesto\r\n- **Ruta de descompilación JADX:** [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src)\r\n- **Ruta de recursos Apktool:** [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res)\r\n- **Manifiesto:** [`AndroidManifest.xml`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/resources/AndroidManifest.xml)\r\n- **Estadísticas DEX:** 50 clases, 552 métodos, 202 campos y 1,213 cadenas de texto.\r\n- **Privilegios:** Ejecuta bajo `android:sharedUserId=\"android.uid.system\"` (`UID 1000`) con `android:usesCleartextTraffic=\"true\"` (permite tráfico HTTP en texto plano) y permisos de nivel firma/sistema (`INSTALL_PACKAGES`, `DELETE_PACKAGES`, `BACKUP`, `MASTER_CLEAR`, `WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS`).\r\n\r\n### 2.2. Arquitectura de Componentes Declarados\r\n1. **[`BootBroadcastReceiver.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/sources/tv/upgrade/service/BootBroadcastReceiver.java):**\r\n   - Escucha `android.intent.action.BOOT_COMPLETED` con prioridad `1000`.\r\n   - Al arrancar el equipo, inicia en segundo plano el servicio principal [`AppUpgradeService`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/sources/tv/upgrade/service/AppUpgradeService.java).\r\n2. **[`AppUpgradeService.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/sources/tv/upgrade/service/AppUpgradeService.java):**\r\n   - Servicio central de aprovisionamiento y actualización silenciosa de APKs de ZTE.\r\n   - Se comunica con el proveedor de configuración \n<truncated 13687 of 23579 bytes from the middle of the output>\n (`encrypt` / `decrypt`):**\r\n   - En [`AdbAuthCheckUtil.java` (líneas 221-235)](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/settings/adbsettings/AdbAuthCheckUtil.java#L221-L235), la función `encrypt(String)` aplica una operación **XOR bit a bit con el carácter `'t'` (`0x74`)** a cada carácter de la cadena:\r\n     ```java\r\n     for (int i = 0; i < charArray.length; i++) {\r\n         charArray[i] = (char) (charArray[i] ^ 't');\r\n     }\r\n     ```\r\n   - Antes de cifrar el contador numérico de intentos restantes, ZTE le suma la constante `confusion = 99` (`String.valueOf(count + 99)`).\r\n   - Por ejemplo:\r\n     - En el perfil estándar (`TOTAL_COUNT = 6`), el valor inicial autorizado `6 + 99 = 105` (`\"105\"`) XOR `'t'` produce la cadena de 3 caracteres `\"EED\"`.\r\n     - En el perfil Megacable (`TOTAL_COUNT_FOR_MEGA = 15`), `15 + 99 = 114` (`\"114\"`) XOR `'t'` produce `\"EE@\"`.\r\n     - El valor centinela sin inicializar (`600 + 99 = 699`, `\"699\"`) XOR `'t'` corresponde a `\"BMM\"`.\r\n3. **Temporizador de Expiración de ADB (`AmxAdbCheckService.java`):**\r\n   - En [`AmxAdbCheckService.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/settings/MexicAmco/AmxAdbCheckService.java), un `TimerTask` periódico se ejecuta cada 15 minutos (`900,000 ms`) y verifica si han transcurrido 14 días (`1,209,600,000 ms`) en Claro/AMX o 7 días (`604,800,000 ms`) en Megacable desde el timestamp guardado en `/cache/recovery/last_QR_Time`. Al expirar dicho plazo, restablece el contador y desactiva `Settings.Global.ADB_ENABLED`.\r\n\r\n### 3.5. Aprovisionamiento de Llaves DRM Widevine L1 y Google Attestation (`AMXUpdateAtvKey`)\r\nDentro del paquete `com.control.device.settings.MexicAmco.AMXUpdateAtvKey` ([`WidevineKeyUtil.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/settings/MexicAmco/AMXUpdateAtvKey/WidevineKeyUtil.java), [`AttestationKeyUtil.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/settings/MexicAmco/AMXUpdateAtvKey/AttestationKeyUtil.java) y [`HttpUtil.java`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/settings/MexicAmco/AMXUpdateAtvKey/HttpUtil.java)):\r\n- El servicio comprueba mediante `MediaDrm` (`WIDEVINE_UUID`) si la propiedad `systemId` es igual a `\"24428\"` (`INVALIDATE_SYSTEM_ID`, que identifica una llave Widevine de prueba/inválida).\r\n- Si detecta una llave inválida, solicita un token OAuth (`client_credentials`), descarga los paquetes `widevine_<SerialNo>.zip` (`widevine_<SN>_enc.bin` + `widevine_<SN>_hash.txt`) y `attestation_<SerialNo>.zip`, verifica su SHA-256, y los inyecta directamente en el almacenamiento seguro (UnifyKey / Keymaster de Amlogic) invocando `SystemControlManager.writeWidevineKey()` (tipo `17`) y `SystemControlManager.writeAttestationKey()` (tipo `66`).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 4. Estructura de Archivos Guardados en el Repositorio\r\n\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/INFORME_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE.md): Este informe técnico detallado.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/jadx_src): Código fuente Java completo descompilado de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/AppUpgradeService/apktool_res): Recursos XML, `AndroidManifest.xml` y código `smali` de `AppUpgradeService.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/control/device): Código fuente Java propietario de ZTE descompilado de `ControlDevice.apk`.\r\n- [`experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/android/tv/settings/`](file:///c:/Users/CORSAIR/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_DESCOMPILACION_REA_CONTROLDEVICE_Y_APPUPGRADE/ControlDevice/jadx_src/sources/com/android/tv/settings): Módulos de ajustes de TV personalizados por ZTE dentro de `ControlDevice.apk`.\r\n"}
